 20:00\n- Tango: 20:00–21:00 + Practica\n\nKREATIVHAUS\nFischerinsel 3\, 
 10179 Berlin – Mitte\n\nCome learn\, dance and enjoy the music! \nSee yo
 u on the dance floor!\n----------\nQuelle: Veranstalter\n\nVeranstalter: A
