SUMMARY:La Milonguita Nota Negra
LOCATION:NOIR café\, Graefestraße 82\, Berlin
DESCRIPTION:Milonga: NOIRCAFÉ Saturday Dinner Menue \nStandard Menue\n\n L
 a Milonguita Nota Negra \n----------\nThe darker the night\, the sweeter t
 he dance.\n- Entrée 2 € - donations welcome\nAperitif - 18:00 -19:00\n\
 n- PRACTICA\nStarter\nA taste of tango walking\, seasoned with rhythm — 
 exploring which steps and styles pair best with each piece of music.\nThis
  week: Lucianita and Kojo\nA first sip of rhythm- a slow awakening for the
  senses\nMain Course - 19:00 - 22:00\n\nLa Milonguita Nota Negra\nA rich b
 lend of Argentine classics and hidden gems\, carefully seasoned by DJ mojo
